      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 34 · AI Compliance Checker\nChecks policies, marketing copy or contracts against GDPR/brand/regulatory rules and reports violations with fixes.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/compliance-checker` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"document\": \"Black Friday email\",\n \"content\": \"Guaranteed lowest price anywhere! Unsubscribe by replying STOP within 30 days.\",\n \"rules\": \"Must include physical address\"\n}\n```"
      }
